 be a wrong note in measure 9: should the D be D flat?", "raw": "great music!\nI think there may be a wrong note in measure 9: should the D be D flat?", "access": {"can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_reply": false}, "url": "https://musescore.com/user/20814871/scores/132011#comment-6179717", "user_url": "https://musescore.com/user/20814871", "user": {"id": "20814871", "is_author": false, "url": "https://musescore.com/user/20814871", "name": "m-musescore", "avatar_url": "https://musescore.com/static/musescore/userdata/avatar/default.jpg@100x100?cache=0", "is_pro": false, "is_staff": false, "is_moderator": false}, "annotation": null}, {"id": "5595506", "score_id": "132011", "user_id": "39102", "date_created": "1592570823", "date_updated": "1592571146", "body": "I think, the d in measure 9 should be d-flat and the c in the alto of measure 37 should be an a-flat.\r\n\r\n I really love the fugue, especially the part from measure 77 on, when Bach introduces the sixteenth notes motif. Thanks for sharing this.", "parent_id": 0, "thread": "00002/", "annotation_page": "-1", "annotation_axis_x": "undefined", "annotation_axis_y": "undefined", "annotation_width": "undefined", "annotation_height": "undefined", "source_id": "1", "likes_count": "0", "is_deleted": false, "is_liked": false, "user_name": "Tonsetzer", "user_uri": "tonsetzer", "date_avatar_updated": "1483948213", "status": "1", "is_pro": null, "date": "Jun 19, 2020", "html": "I think, the d in measure 9 should be d-flat and the c in the alto of measure 37 should be an a-flat.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n I really love the fugue, especially the part from measure 77 on, when Bach introduces the sixteenth notes motif. Thanks for sharing this.", "raw": "I think, the d in measure 9 should be d-flat and the c in the alto of measure 37 should be an a-flat.\r\n\r\n I really love the fugue, especially the part from measure 77 on, when Bach introduces the sixteenth notes motif. Thanks for sharing this.", "access": {"can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_reply": false}, "url": "https://musescore.com/user/39102/scores/132011#comment-5595506", "user_url": "https://musescore.com/tonsetzer", "user": {"id": "39102", "is_author": false, "url": "https://musescore.com/tonsetzer", "name": "Tonsetzer", "avatar_url": "https://musescore.com/static/musescore/userdata/avatar/9/1/d/39102.jpg@100x100?cache=1483948213", "is_pro": false, "is_staff": false, "is_moderator": false}, "annotation": null}, {"id": "175899", "score_id": "132011", "user_id": "13172", "date_created": "1380600343", "date_updated": "1380600343", "body": "Thank you very much indeed for the correction.\r\nI will update the description accordingly. ", "parent_id": 0, "thread": "00001/", "annotation_page": "-1", "annotation_axis_x": "", "annotation_axis_y": "", "annotation_width": "", "annotation_height": "", "source_id": "0", "likes_count": "0", "is_deleted": false, "is_liked": false, "user_name": "verits99", "user_uri": "", "date_avatar_updated": "1483948208", "status": "1", "is_pro": null, "date": "Oct 1, 2013", "html": "Thank you very much indeed for the correction.<br />\r\nI will update the description accordingly. ", "raw": "Thank you very much indeed for the correction.\r\nI will update the description accordingly. ", "access": {"can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_reply": false}, "url": "https://musescore.com/user/13172/scores/132011#comment-175899", "user_url": "https://musescore.com/user/13172", "user": {"id": "13172", "is_author": false, "url": "https://musescore.com/user/13172", "name": "verits99", "avatar_url": "https://musescore.com/static/musescore/userdata/avatar/8/4/6/13172.jpg@100x100?cache=1483948208", "is_pro": false, "is_staff": false, "is_moderator": false}, "annotation": null}, {"id": "175785", "score_id": "132011", "user_id": "84251", "date_created": "1380559260", "date_updated": "1380559260", "body": "Clearly indicated in the autograph, this piece is intended for lute OR keyboard: \r\n\r\nhttp://erato.uvt.nl/files/imglnks/usimg/0/01/IMSLP112000-PMLP181067-bwv998_pre-fug_para_alaude_ou_cravo_cravo.pdf\r\n\r\nJ. S. Bach did not invent the lautenwerck.  However, he did draw up a specification for one to be built for him by the organ builder Zacharias Hildebrandt:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.baroquemusic.org/barluthp.html\r\n\r\nA few years ago I had the opportunity to play this piece on a lautenwerck built by Steven Sorli.  It was great fun.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.lautenwerk.com/index.htm\r\n\r\n", "parent_id": 0, "thread": "00000/", "annotation_page": "-1", "annotation_axis_x": "", "annotation_axis_y": "", "annotation_width": "", "annotation_height": "", "source_id": "0", "likes_count": "0", "is_deleted": false, "is_liked": false, "user_name": "Clarin Pardo", "user_uri": "", "date_avatar_updated": "1483948223", "status": "1", "is_pro": "1115623", "date": "Sep 30, 2013", "html": "Clearly indicated in the autograph, this piece is intended for lute OR keyboard: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttp://erato.uvt.nl/files/imglnks/usimg/0/01/IMSLP112000-PMLP181067-bwv998_pre-fug_para_alaude_ou_cravo_cravo.pdf<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJ. S. Bach did not invent the lautenwerck.  However, he did draw up a specification for one to be built for him by the organ builder Zacharias Hildebrandt:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttp://www.baroquemusic.org/barluthp.html<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA few years ago I had the opportunity to play this piece on a lautenwerck built by Steven Sorli.  It was great fun.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nhttp://www.lautenwerk.com/index.htm<br />\r\n<br />\r\n", "raw": "Clearly indicated in the autograph, this piece is intended for lute OR keyboard: \r\n\r\nhttp://erato.uvt.nl/files/imglnks/usimg/0/01/IMSLP112000-PMLP181067-bwv998_pre-fug_para_alaude_ou_cravo_cravo.pdf\r\n\r\nJ. S. Bach did not invent the lautenwerck.  However, he did draw up a specification for one to be built for him by the organ builder Zacharias Hildebrandt:\r\n\r\nhttp://www.baroquemusic.org/barluthp.html\r\n\r\nA few years ago I had the opportunity to play this piece on a lautenwerck built by Steven Sorli.  It was great fun.\r\n\r\nhttp://www.lautenwerk.com/index.htm\r\n\r\n", "access": {"can_delete": false, "can_edit": false, "can_reply": false}, "url": "https://musescore.com/user/84251/scores/132011#comment-175785", "user_url": "https://musescore.com/user/84251", "user": {"id": "84251", "is_author": false, "url": "https://musescore.com/user/84251", "name": "Clarin Pardo", "avatar_url": "https://musescore.com/static/musescore/userdata/avatar/7/e/f/84251.jpg@100x100?cache=1483948223", "is_pro": true, "is_staff": false, "is_moderator": false}, "annotation": null}], "comments_total": 4}, "composer": {"id": 2, "name": "Bach", "uri": "bach", "featured": 1, "url": "https://musescore.com/sheetmusic/artists/bach"}, "count_views": 3984, "count_favorites": 30, "count_comments": 4, "privacy_string": "<i class=\"icon-public\"></i> Everyone can see this score", "license_string": "<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/\" target=\"_blank\"><i class=\"icon-cc-zero\"></i> Creative Commons copyright waiver</a>", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/", "is_user_follow": false, "as_pro": false, "isAddedToFavorite": false, "isAddedToSpotlight": false, "is_banned_user": false, "genres": [{"name": "classical", "url_to_search": "/sheetmusic/classical"}], "secret": null, "blocker_info": null, "opened_dispute": false, "pr_show": false, "is_download_limited": false, "error_description": null, "copyright_details": [], "private_link_secret": null, "is_public_domain": true, "is_waiting_for_moderate": false, "score_user_count": 0, "limit_download_count": 20, "is_blocked": false, "song": {"id": 7390, "name": "Prelude, Fugue and Allegro in E-flat major, BWV 998", "artist": {"id": 26416, "name": "Johann Sebastian Bach", "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://musescore.com/artist/johann_sebastian_bach-26416"}}}, "_links": {"self": {"href": "https://musescore.com/song/prelude_fugue_and_al